    <description>Fraud monitoring record capturing reCAPTCHA v3 score and environmental variables (IP, geolocation, browser, OS, device) for every Registration, Login, and Submission event. One record is created per active Application a Contact has, per event, per ECRMSF-5511/ECRMSF-5529. See docs/fraud-monitoring-recaptcha-ip-geo.md for full design.</description>
